  "key_concepts": [
    "Primitive SOP is the primitive-level complement to Point SOP.",
    "It can transform primitives and profile curves, but profile Z translate/scale is ignored and profile rotation is only meaningful around Z.",
    "Template transforms move existing primitives to template points rather than creating copies like Copy SOP.",
    "Face/Hull controls handle primitive closure, clamping, vertex sorting, and texture-facing behavior."
